WEBVTT

00:00:08,910 --> 00:00:17,910
With my last cheek swab, you added a number of supplements to my list after I take them, I often get blurry eyes and sometimes a headache any suggestions.

00:00:17,910 --> 00:00:21,910
I am doing liver pack every day too.

00:00:21,910 --> 00:00:28,910
I would say make sure number one, you're taking these with food and maybe try to break them up a little bit more.

00:00:28,910 --> 00:00:43,910
It also concerns me when a person says they have a reaction to a supplement that there is not at least the possibility that their reaction is not to the supplement but to the capsule.

00:00:43,910 --> 00:01:00,910
So if you would try to open the capsules, I can't remember what I added to your list but if you try to open the capsules, if they are capsules, they do away with the capsule and just put that into a shaker or something, sprinkle it on your food, something like that.

00:01:00,910 --> 00:01:03,910
Try that and see if that makes a difference.

00:01:03,910 --> 00:01:24,910
It's not a uncommon thing that people can have a sensitivity to the components of the capsule door isn't an uncommon thing that people can actually have antibodies to the gelatin that can be in capsules, even natural capsules like the ones we have.

